                                                "sense_id": "531db7b0-d3dd-38b5-ad03-8c07aac417ed",
                                                "text": "The girl, who has not been publicly identified, sold more than 300 boxes in six hours, her father told ABC 10. Boxes now sell for as much as $5 in parts of the country, so she probably raised more than $1,500. Yes, there’s money in the munchies."
